# Line endings are load-bearing here: the golden tests hash chunked fixture
# text, possession binding hashes raw corpus bytes, and a calibration set's
# id IS the sha256 of its file — a CRLF checkout would silently change all
# three. Everything is committed and checked out as LF, and the fixtures,
# the calibration sets and vendored assets are never converted at all.
* text=auto eol=lf
tests/fixtures/** -text
calibration/** -text
app/static/vendor/** -text
*.png binary
*.npy binary
